=== Honeyhive ===
A '''Queen Bee Shard''' has a {{Chance|2.08%|1|48|rolls}} chance to be obtained from a [[Honeyhive]].

=== Fusion ===
A '''Queen Bee Shard''' can be obtained through [[Fusion]], specifically [[Chameleon Fusion]].
{{Fusion Obtaining Table}}

== Usage ==
=== Syphoning ===
{{Attribute Usage
