When the {{Gold|Honey Refill}} attribute triggers, the following message is displayed:
{{Dialogue|&d&lQUEEN BEE! &eThe &6Honeyhive&e instantly refilled with loot!}}

=== Fusion ===
A '''Queen Bee Shard''' is required to [[Fusion|fuse]] {{Item|Queen Snake Shard}}.

A '''Queen Bee Shard''' can be used in [[Fusion]] to create other [[Shards]].
{{Fusion Usage Table}}

